{"title": "Draconic Elemental Weapon: Fire", "pageid": 23532, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon:_Fire", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Transmutation spells", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elemental_Weapon_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Elemental_Weapon_Fire.webp/300px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire.webp, /w/images/b/bf/Elemental_Weapon_Fire.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Elemental_Weapon_Fire.webp/300px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Elemental_Weapon_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Draconic Elemental Weapon: Fire</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 transmutation spell</a>. This spell is a variant of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon\">Draconic Elemental Weapon</a> and imbues a weapon with icy might, granting it bonus <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span> damage and a +1 bonus to attack rolls.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nImbue a weapon with an icy might. It receives a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_MAG_ElementalWeapon_Fire</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_ElementalWeapon_Fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_ElementalWeapon_Fire\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Elemental_Weapon:_Fire\"> Condition: Elemental Weapon: Fire </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Weapon:_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Elemental Weapon: Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Weapon: Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Weapon:_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Elemental Weapon: Fire (Condition)\">Elemental Weapon: Fire</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/60px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/80px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon\">Draconic Elemental Weapon</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>You can use this spell to enchant a different weapon. Equip <a href=\"/wiki/Drakethroat_Glaive\" title=\"Drakethroat Glaive\">Drakethroat Glaive</a> and throw the weapon you want to enchant onto the ground. Target the weapon on the ground with the buff, then pick it up and equip it.</li>\n<li>A <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> can target two weapons using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Twinned_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/25px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/38px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/50px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/25px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Twinned_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\">Metamagic: Twinned Spell</a>.</li>\n<li>This spell can target weapons and non-enemy creatures with a weapon in their main hand.</li>\n<li>This effect does not stack with other variants of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Draconic Elemental Weapon\">Draconic Elemental Weapon</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Elemental Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Weapon\" title=\"Elemental Weapon\">Elemental Weapon</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Age\" title=\"Elemental Age\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Age\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Elemental_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Age\" title=\"Elemental Age\">Elemental Age</a>.</li>\n<li>It does stack with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Weapon\" title=\"Magic Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Magic_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Weapon\" title=\"Magic Weapon\">Magic Weapon</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715051250\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4120/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 54828/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 23154/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1560315/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n113.73%   82.027     51 Template:Trim\n100.00%   72.122      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   72.122      1 -total\n 32.52%   23.456     11 Template:Icon_text\n 29.85%   21.531      9 Template:Icon_link\n 24.21%   17.460      6 Template:SAI\n 15.75%   11.360      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.74%   10.628     11 Template:Ifempty\n 12.05%    8.689      1 Template